{"sha": "4d4fb8824288520b42dc763b003c1d9a3918fc0c2f20a6b73674bf9f6c520a1c", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g12:sound-acoustics} 章 --- 声音与声学}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:sound-acoustics:1}", "$\\lambda = v/f$：(a) $340/55 \\approx \\qty{6.2}{m}$；(b)", "\\qty{0.34}{m}；(c) \\qty{2.3}{cm}。比值 $15000/55 \\approx 270$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:sound-acoustics:2}", "次声波：\\qty{8}{Hz}。可闻声：\\qty{100}{Hz} 和 \\qty{15}{kHz}。", "超声波：\\qty{40}{kHz} 和 \\qty{3}{MHz}。音调较低者：", "\\qty{100}{Hz}（频率较低）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:sound-acoustics:3}", "钢轨：$1000/5000 = \\qty{0.20}{s}$；空气：$1000/340 \\approx", "\\qty{2.9}{s}$。两次敲击相隔 \\qty{2.7}{s}，先到达的是钢轨传来的声音。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:sound-acoustics:4}", "(a) $L = 10\\log_{10}10^{7} = \\qty{70}{dB}$。(b) $I = 10^{-12} \\times", "10^{6} = \\qty{1.0e-6}{W/m^2}$。(c) \\qty{70}{dB}：吸尘器；", "\\qty{60}{dB}：交谈。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:sound-acoustics:5}", "\\qtylist{392;588;784}{Hz}。其较高的谐音（$n \\ge 2$）从", "\\qty{24}{kHz} 开始，高于可闻上限：只能听到 \\qty{12}{kHz}", "的基音。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:sound-acoustics:6}", "$I = 0.50/(4\\pi \\times 25) \\approx \\qty{1.6e-3}{W/m^2}$；", "$L = 10\\log_{10}(\\num{1.6e9}) \\approx \\qty{92}{dB}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:sound-acoustics:7}", "两台：$+\\qty{3}{dB} \\to \\qty{71}{dB}$；四台：\\qty{74}{dB}。", "$+\\qty{10}{dB}$ 需要强度 $\\times 10$，即 $10$ 把小提琴。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:sound-acoustics:8}", "$r \\times 4$：$I \\div 16$，因此 $-\\qty{12}{dB}$：\\qty{83}{dB}。是的，", "刚好低于 \\qty{85}{dB} 的界限。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:sound-acoustics:9}", "空气：$340/440 \\approx \\qty{0.77}{m}$；水：$1500/440 \\approx", "\\qty{3.4}{m}$。频率由声源决定；波长", "$\\lambda = v/f$ 随介质而变。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:sound-acoustics:10}", "$f_1 = \\qty{130}{Hz}$（峰间距）。相同之处：各条谱线位置", "$nf_1$（音调相同）以及总强度；不同之处：谱线高度", "——正是这种组合形成了音色。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:sound-acoustics:11}", "$v = 2Lf_1 = 2 \\times 0.650 \\times 110 = \\qty{143}{m/s}$。八度：", "$L' = v/(2 \\times 220) = L/2 = \\qty{32.5}{cm}$；五度：", "$L' = 143/330 \\approx \\qty{43.3}{cm} = 2L/3$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:sound-acoustics:12}", "$\\lambda = 1540/\\num{5.0e6} \\approx \\qty{0.31}{mm}$。深度 $= vt/2$：", "$1540 \\times \\num{26e-6}/2 \\approx \\qty{2.0}{cm}$ 和", "$1540 \\times \\num{58e-6}/2 \\approx \\qty{4.5}{cm}$；厚度", "$\\approx \\qty{2.5}{cm}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:sound-acoustics:13}", "$-\\qty{25}{dB}$ 意味着 $I \\div 10^{2.5} \\approx 316$，因此", "$r \\times \\sqrt{316} \\approx 17.8$：$r \\approx 3.0 \\times 17.8", "\\approx \\qty{53}{m}$。大厅的实际情况有所不同：地面与墙壁的反射", "会增加声强，而空气和听众会吸收声能（且", "舞台并非各向同性的点声源）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:sound-acoustics:14}", "$1/10^{-12} = 10^{12}$。鼓膜面积 $S = \\qty{5e-5}{m^2}$：听阈时的接收", "功率为 $\\qty{5e-17}{W}$，痛阈时为 $\\qty{5e-5}{W}$——耳朵能探测到", "几十阿瓦的功率，并且在声强达到其万亿倍时仍能工作：", "这是一种动态范围跨越十二个数量级的探测器。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:sound-acoustics:15}", "$2$：\\qty{83}{dB}；$10$：\\qty{90}{dB}；$100$：\\qty{100}{dB}。每", "增加 \\qty{+10}{dB}，扬声器的成本就要增加十倍：响度竞赛的代价", "呈指数增长（而且在分出胜负之前，早已危险）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:g12:sound-acoustics:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $v = 2Lf_1 = 2 \\times 0.650 \\times 110 = \\qty{143}{m/s}$。", "", "\\textbf{2.} 弦上 $\\lambda_1 = 2L = \\qty{1.30}{m}$；在空气中", "$\\lambda = 340/110 \\approx \\qty{3.1}{m}$。$f$ 相同，但", "$\\lambda = v/f$，且两者的波速不同。", "", "\\textbf{3.} $L' = v/(2 \\times 220) = L/2 = \\qty{32.5}{cm}$：", "第十二品位于中点，距琴桥 $L/2$ 处。", "", "\\textbf{4.} $L' = 143/(2 \\times 165) \\approx \\qty{43.3}{cm} = 2L/3$。", "", "\\textbf{5.} $\\log(220/110)/\\log 2^{1/12} = 12$ 个半音——", "十二品即为一个八度。第一品：$L_1 = L/2^{1/12} = 65.0/1.059", "\\approx \\qty{61.4}{cm}$。", "", "\\textbf{6.} \\qtylist{110;220;330;440;550}{Hz}。", "", "\\textbf{7.} $\\qty{440}{Hz} = 4f_1$：第四次谐波，", "高两个八度；$\\qty{330}{Hz} = 3f_1$：第三次谐波，", "高一个八度加一个五度。", ""]}